Root cause:
The bug was caused by not clearing the old `URLContext` pointer (`hd`) when closing it, which could lead to issues with stale pointers when attempting to open new HTTP URLs that require authentication or redirection. This could result in the application trying to use an invalid or outdated context, leading to unexpected behavior or crashes.

